  "farmersdelight.configuration.enableFoodEffectTooltip": "Ntuziaka Mmetụta nri",
  "farmersdelight.configuration.enableFoodEffectTooltip.tooltip": "Ọ bụrụ na agbanyere ya, ihe nri ga-egosipụta ndụmọdụ ngwaọrụ na-egosi mmetụta ha na-enye mgbe e riri ya, ọ bụrụ na ọ bụla.Na-emetụta nri sitere na ma Minecraft na mod a.",
  "farmersdelight.configuration.enableNourishmentHungerOverlay": "Mkpuchi agụụ nri nri",
  "farmersdelight.configuration.enableNourishmentHungerOverlay.tooltip": "Ọ bụrụ na agbanyere ya, a ga-egosipụta ihe mkpuchi nwere ọla edo n'elu mita nri mgbe onye ọkpụkpọ nwere mmetụta Nri.",
  "farmersdelight.configuration.enablePumpkinPieSneakToPlace": "Sneak na Ebe Pumpkin Pie",
